<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices level in lackluster trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices level in lackluster trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diammonium phosphate and ammonia cash values were unchanged in quiet trade Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Many in the DAP trade will be attending the Southwestern Fertilizer Conference in New Orleans next week, where the tone for fall fertilizer prices will be set, cash sources said.</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172		     unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  186-188		 unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		175		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
